---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro"; import FdeNav from "../../components/FdeNav.astro"; import {companies} from "../../data/fde";
---
<Base title="FDE Company Map | FDE Career Atlas" description="How companies organize forward-deployed work, including role variants and primary career sources." pageSlug="fde-companies"><FdeNav/><div class="shell companies"><header><p class="eyebrow">COMPANY MAP</p><h1>One company may contain an entire FDE role family.</h1><p>That is the market signal: forward-deployed work is becoming an organization with specialized engineering, domain, infrastructure, and delivery roles, not one generic job.</p></header><section class="evidence"><div><span>CASE 01</span><h2>OpenAI</h2><p>FDE, Forward Deployed Software Engineer, healthcare and government variants, Technical Deployment Lead, and management roles separate software depth, domain constraints, and deployment leadership.</p></div><div><span>CASE 02</span><h2>Cognition</h2><p>A broader Customer Engineering organization includes applied AI, deployed, federal, partner, support, and infrastructure roles, different specialists around customer outcomes.</p></div><div><span>CASE 03</span><h2>Scale AI</h2><p>GenAI, frontier-agent, public-sector, ML, product, and leadership variants show specialization by technology, sector, and ownership surface.</p></div></section><section><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRIMARY-SOURCE DIRECTORY</p><h2>Start with the official organization.</h2></div><p>Role availability changes. The durable value here is the operating model; follow the source for current openings.</p></div><div class="directory">{companies.map((c,i)=><a href={c.source} rel="noopener"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><div><small>{c.family}</small><h3>{c.name}</h3><p>{c.variants}</p></div><b>Official source ↗</b></a>)}</div></section></div></Base>
<style>.companies{max-width:1150px}.companies header{padding:6rem 0}.companies header h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);max-width:14ch}.companies header>p:last-child{color:var(--fg-muted);max-width:62ch}.evidence{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);background:#18181b;color:white;margin:0 calc(50% - 50vw);padding:5rem max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - 1150px)/2 + var(--pad)))}.evidence>div{padding:1.2rem;border-right:1px solid #39393e}.evidence span,.directory>a>span,.directory small{font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);color:#ed8a59}.evidence h2{color:white}.evidence p{font-size:.78rem;color:#b7b7be}.companies section:last-child{padding:6rem 0}.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:end}.section-head>p{color:var(--fg-muted)}.directory{margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.directory>a{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr auto;padding:1rem;color:var(--fg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.directory>a:hover{text-decoration:none;background:#fff1e6}.directory small{color:var(--accent)}.directory h3,.directory p{margin:.1rem 0}.directory p{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--fg-muted)}.directory b{align-self:center;font:500 .65rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent)}@media(max-width:700px){.evidence,.section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.directory>a{grid-template-columns:2rem 1fr}.directory b{grid-column:2}}</style>
